+### Vector Magnitude
+Computes the Euclidean norm (length) of a 4D vector [S2, unofficial]. The formula is $\|u\| = \sqrt{\sum_{i=0}^{3} u_i^2}$, where $u$ is the vector and $\|u\|$ is the magnitude [S2, unofficial].
 
